udentRepository.cs - Data access\n6. ✅ Repository/IStudentRepository.cs - Repository interface\n7. ✅ Model/Student.cs - Domain model\n8. ✅ Dto/Request/CreateStudentRequestDto.cs - Request DTO\n9. ✅ Dto/Request/UpdateStudentRequestDto.cs - Request DTO\n10. ✅ Dto/Response/StudentResponseDto.cs - Response DTO\n11. ✅ Mock-Data/StudentMock.cs - Mock data store\n\n#### .NET 8 API Usage Analysis\n\n**✅ Modern .NET 8 Features Used**:\n- **Minimal APIs**: Correctly implemented using `MapGroup()` and endpoint mapping\n- **Top-level statements**: Program.cs uses modern top-level statements\n- **Implicit usings**: Code doesn't repeat common using statements\n- **Nullable reference types**: Properly using `required` keyword and nullable annotations\n- **TimeProvider**: Modern time abstraction registered (line 10 in StudentApiEndpoints.cs)\n\n**Code Sample - Modern .NET 8 Pattern**:\n```csharp\n// Endpoint/StudentApiEndpoints.cs:10-11\nservices.AddSingleton(TimeProvider.System);\nservices.AddScoped<IStudentRepository, StudentRepository>();\n```\n\nThis demonstrates proper use of the new `TimeProvider` abstraction introduced in .NET 8 for testable time-dependent code.\n\n---\n\n### Configuration Files Analysis\n\n#### appsettings.json\n**File**: `/modernize-data/studio-data/TNT1001/APP2151/transformed-code/129/studio-workspace/Component /appsettings.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Logging\": {\n    \"LogLevel\": {\n      \"Default\": \"Information\",\n      \"Microsoft.AspNetCore\": \"Warning\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"AllowedHosts\": \"*\"\n}\n```\n\n**Status**: ✅ Compatible with .NET 8.0\n- Standard logging configuration\n- No deprecated settings\n- No upgrade required\n\n---\n\n### Identified Issues (Non-Blocking)\n\n#### Issue #1: Code Quality - Unnecessary Task.Run Usage\n**Severity**: Low  \n**File**: Repository/StudentRepository.cs (multiple locations)  \n**Lines**: 11, 18, 24, 28, 37\n\n**Problem**:\n```csharp\n// Current (inefficient)\npublic async Task<Student> CreateStudent(Student s